#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/049/KinGmc111_04907:TEXT_KINGMC111_04907_WUKLAMAT_000_182:1"
msgid "There's hope for this forest yet, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. I can feel it."
msgstr "Этому лесу ещё можно помочь, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Я это чувствую."
